    "sections": {
        "description": "Pet Care Store theme is a thoughtfully structured theme designed for building modern online shops focused on pet products and services. It supports seamless integration with WooCommerce, making it suitable for creating a pet shop, animal store, or veterinary product website. The layout is optimized for clear product presentation, helping highlight pet food, accessories, grooming items, and pet supplies without clutter. Built with Gutenberg compatibility, the theme allows flexible customization using blocks while maintaining consistent design elements. It includes clean typography, organized sections, and intuitive navigation to enhance user experience. Pet Care Store theme is ideal for pet business owners looking to manage an online pet store, showcase pet care services, or promote animal-related products efficiently."
    },
